From d4b0d69fdfde4ab6dbf118b5fae4dc3cf6fb35b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dcasati <dcasati@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 09:37:42 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] ath12k/LinuxKPI: remove M4/controlled-port experiment code

Drop the qwz_port_policy sysctl, M4 staging work, first_key_early,
qwz_bootstrap, tx_de_stats and m4_after_keys knobs and their tests.
The controlled port now opens only on an acknowledged M4, and
ath12k_mac_set_key drains pending TX before installing the PTK.

Built and unit-tested; not yet validated on WCN7850 hardware.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
